  "2026-11-06T12:36:23.991Z",codex-agent,"Public proof is complete for three reproduced historical defects across two public packages: Beads numeric preservation, Jev Unicode tokenization, and Jev UTF-8 exemplar packing. Each reduces 16 atoms to 1 with independent failing-final and passing-deletion observations, retained caller-owned immutable result snapshots, frozen native source revisions, and public source hashes. Reservations/actual executions are 8/10, 8/10 and 6/8. Five pending-result handoffs and ten independent resume questions pass for each. Packets include frozen oracle identities and latest operation receipts; full JSON evidence retains the complete independently checked reduction snapshots. No synthetic defect is counted as real data."
  "2026-11-06T14:35:52.749Z",codex-agent,"Review-loop checkpoint on b34b0c4: CI test (26) and codeql completed successfully; test (22) remains queued. CodeRabbit automatic review was skipped for the new repository policy and the shared queue is awaiting its manual review request. No review completion or actionable thread is recorded yet; skipped and neutral bot checks are not treated as review approval."
